{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56048","headline":"寄王振拾遗 · 齐己","name":"寄王振拾遗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"折槛意何如？平安信不虚。\n近来焚谏草，深去觅山居。\n志定荣枯外，身全宠辱余。\n分明知在处，难寄乱离书。\n（同前。\n）（按：《全唐诗》卷八三八收此诗缺九字，今重录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56048.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56048","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}